<title>USA: North Carolina elects REIT status for '95.</title>
<headline>North Carolina elects REIT status for '95.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The North Carolina Railroad Co said on Friday that its board of directors had voted to elect tax status as a Real Estate Investment Trust for the tax year ended December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that, because of that decision, the the board declared a special cash dividend of $3.06 per share. It is payable on or about October 15, 1996, to holders of record of NCRR common stock on September 27, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
